('biology',1,'The Cell','Cell discovery and Cell Theory','en','Who was the first scientist to use the word "cell" after examining the structure of oak tree cortex?','["Antoine Van Leeuwenhoek", "Robert Hooke", "Robert Brown", "Matthias Schleiden"]'::jsonb,1,'Ministerial-style bank',300),
