('biology',1,'The Cell','Plant cell wall','en','The plant cell wall consists of cellulose in young cells and thickens in older cells by the addition of:','["Pectin", "Chitin", "Lignin", "Tubulin"]'::jsonb,2,'Ministerial-style bank',307),
