('biology',1,'The Cell','Mitochondria','en','The inner membrane folds of mitochondria that increase surface area are called:','["Cisternae", "Thylakoids", "Cristae", "Grana"]'::jsonb,2,'Ministerial-style bank',317),
('biology',1,'الخلية','Mitochondria','ar','يطلق على طيات الغشاء الداخلي للمايتوكوندريا التي تزيد المساحة السطحية اسم:','["\u0627\u0644\u0635\u0647\u0627\u0631\u064a\u062c", "\u0627\u0644\u062b\u0627\u064a\u0644\u0648\u0643\u0648\u064a\u062f\u0627\u062a", "\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0641", "\u0627\u0644\u0643\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a"]'::jsonb,2,'Ministerial-style bank',317),
