('biology',1,'The Cell','Cell division','en','Cell division where cells split without clear nuclear or cytoplasmic changes, as in bacteria, is called:','["Mitosis", "Meiosis", "Amitosis", "Cytokinesis"]'::jsonb,2,'Ministerial-style bank',345),
